---

<Base
  title="About Dr. Mandy Manna"
  meta_title="About Dr. Mandy Manna - Educational Leader & Agricultural Innovation Expert"
  description="Learn about Dr. Mandy Manna's journey as an educational leader, her work at Fox Chase Farm, and her innovative approaches to urban agricultural education in Philadelphia."
  image="/images/dr-mandy-manna.jpg"
>
  <!-- Section Navigation -->
  <SectionNavigation sections={navigationSections} client:load />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    id="hero"
    class="relative pt-16 pb-12"
    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f1 0%, #fafaf8 50%, #f0f4f1 100%);"
  >
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="relative inline-block mb-6">
          <img
            src={profileImg.src}
            alt="Dr. Mandy Manna"
            class="w-64 h-64 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto shadow-2xl"
            style="border: 4px solid white; object-position: center 30%;"
          />
        </div>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-semibold mb-3"
          style="color: #1a2e1e;"
        >
          Dr. Mandy Manna
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base font-semibold tracking-wide mb-6" style="color: #4a7c59;">
          Ag Innovation Expert &bull; Educational Leader &bull; Farm Administrator
        </p>

        <div
          class="rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8"
          style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f0eb 0%, #f0f4f1 100%); border: 1px solid #dde8de;"
        >
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: #3a5040;">
            Transforming urban education through innovative agricultural
            experiences, managing the largest urban public school
            district-operated educational farm in the United States while
            serving 62K+ student visits annually across 60 schools.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ProfessionalStats stats={statsData} client:load />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Professional Bio -->
  <section id="bio" class="py-16" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3" style="color: #4a7c59;">Biography</span>
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-10"
        style="color: #1a2e1e;"
      >
        Professional Biography
      </h2>
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl p-8"
        style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6f9f6 0%, #fafaf8 100%); border: 1px solid #dde8de;"
      >
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: #3a5040;">
          Dr. Mandy Manna is a nationally recognized agricultural education
          leader and the driving force behind one of the most innovative urban
          farm programs in the United States. As Farm Administrator at Fox Chase
          Farm, the largest urban public school district-operated educational
          farm in the country, she has spent more than a decade transforming a
          112-acre Philadelphia landmark into a living classroom that serves
          62,000+ students annually across 60 schools.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: #3a5040;">
          A 2024 Neubauer Fellow and National Board Certified educator, Dr.
          Manna holds a Doctor of Education in Educational Leadership and brings
          deep expertise in curriculum design, workforce development, and
          Controlled Environment Agriculture (CEA). She has secured over $2.2
          million in competitive grants to fund programming, equipment, and
          staffing and has built Pennsylvania's first district-wide CEA
          pre-apprenticeship pipeline, now operating at multiple Philadelphia
          high schools.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: #3a5040;">
          Her work sits at the intersection of equity, innovation, and
          agriculture, creating career-connected pathways for urban youth while
          championing agriculture as a vehicle for economic development, food
          justice, and community resilience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Professional Experience Timeline -->
  <section id="journey" class="py-16" style="background-color: #f0f4f1;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3" style="color: #4a7c59;">Experience</span>
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-12"
        style="color: #1a2e1e;"
      >
        Professional Journey
      </h2>
      <Timeline items={timelineData} client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Education Section -->
  <section id="education" class="py-16" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3" style="color: #4a7c59;">Academic Background</span>
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-12"
        style="color: #1a2e1e;"
      >
        Educational Excellence
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {
          educationData.map((edu) => (
            <div
              class="rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
              style="background-color: #f6f9f6; border: 1px solid #dde8de;"
            >
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
                <img
                  src={edu.logo}
                  alt={edu.institution}
                  class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg object-cover shadow-sm"
                />
                <div class="flex-1">
                  <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-1" style="color: #1a2e1e;">
                    {edu.degree}
                  </h3>
                  <p class="font-medium text-sm" style="color: #4a7c59;">
                    {edu.field}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-2" style="color: #3a5040;">
                {edu.institution}
              </p>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-xs" style="color: #6b7f70;">
                  {edu.period}
                </span>
                <span
                  class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium"
                  style="background-color: #e8f0eb; color: #2d5a3d;"
                >
                  {edu.status}
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Skills Section -->
  <section id="skills" class="py-12" style="background-color: #f0f4f1;">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3" style="color: #4a7c59;">Expertise</span>
      <h2
        class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-8"
        style="color: #1a2e1e;"
      >
        Professional Skills &amp; Expertise
      </h2>
      <SkillsSection skills={skillsData} client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Recognition & Awards -->
  <section id="recognition" class="py-16" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3" style="color: #4a7c59;">Honors</span>
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-12"
        style="color: #1a2e1e;"
      >
        Recognition &amp; Impact
      </h2>
      <RecognitionSection awards={awardsData} grants={grantsData} client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Values & Philosophy -->
  <section
    id="philosophy"
    class="py-16"
    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f0eb 0%, #f0f4f1 100%);"
  >
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3" style="color: #4a7c59;">Values</span>
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold mb-8"
        style="color: #1a2e1e;"
      >
        Professional Philosophy
      </h2>

      <div
        class="rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm mb-8"
        style="background-color: white; border: 1px solid #dde8de;"
      >
        <blockquote
          class="text-lg italic leading-relaxed"
          style="color: #3a5040;"
        >
          "Imagine a child who is engaged in growing their own fresh food, while
          developing soft skills, and being exposed to entrepreneurial
          experiences through their entire school career. At the Fox Chase Farm
          we strive to bring innovative and strategic ways to create
          student-centered learning opportunities to increase the equity and
          accessibility to all ages and all learning levels using agriculture
          and career pathways as the driving force."
        </blockquote>
        <cite class="block mt-4 font-semibold text-sm" style="color: #4a7c59;">
          Dr. Mandy Manna
        </cite>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm" style="border: 1px solid #dde8de;">
          <div
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
            style="background-color: #2d5a3d;"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: #1a2e1e;">
            Student-Centered Learning
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #6b7f70;">
            Creating authentic, intrinsically motivating educational experiences
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm" style="border: 1px solid #dde8de;">
          <div
            class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
            style="background-color: #3d6849;"
